msgid "Administration is only visible to a <0>platform admin</0>. That is a separate permission from a tenant's <1>owner</1> role, so being the owner of your instance is not enough on its own; opening <2/> without it sends you back to <3>Settings</3>. On a new install the permission goes to the owner of the first tenant, granted when that owner finishes setting up their passkey or sign-in provider. <4/><5/> If you set your instance up on an earlier version, the grant only ran while the API was starting, so the owner never received it. Restart the Nocturne API container once and sign in again. That works as long as nobody currently holds the permission; if someone does, have them grant it to you from <6>Settings > Administration</6>."
